<!-- ============================================================
  Anirudh Jewels — Custom Footer Block
  Shopify me kaise use karein:
  1. Online Store > Themes > Customize
  2. Neeche Footer section tak scroll karein
  3. "Add block" > "Custom Liquid" (ya "Liquid") choose karein
  4. Neeche diya gaya poora code copy karke us Custom Liquid block me paste karein
  5. Save karein aur preview check karein
  Agar aapki existing footer already isi jagah content dikha rahi hai to use
  hide/disable kar dein taaki dono ek saath na dikhein.
============================================================= -->

